WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The squared weight appears in more than one equation in the original example PDF.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Search w^2 with Contains this notation. Two occurrences appear on pages 1 and 2.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Filter the results to page 2.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.300
Save the page-2 occurrence as a bookmark.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.000
Inspect the original PDF excerpt. Chrome navigates to page 2.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A closer look at the actual result cards and the saved occurrence.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Formula Search: a Chrome extension with a local Python backend. Start with the example PDF and README setup.
